  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/IMG_9963.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(35 fotos) El alumnado de segundo ciclo de Primaria del colegio Virgen del Carmen ha pasado esta semana por Espai Natural, en la caller Ceramista Roca, 3 de Onda, dentro de los &#39;work shop&#39; anuales del centro educativo, que</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/IMG_0060.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>el viernes 23 de marzo han incluido yoga en el Parque de la Cer&aacute;mica.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espainaturalworkshopvergecarme/img_9955.jpg\" alt=\"img_9955\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espainaturalworkshopvergecarme/img_9957.jpg\" alt=\"img_9957\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espainaturalworkshopvergecarme/img_9958.jpg\" alt=\"img_9958\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espainaturalworkshopvergecarme/img_9962.jpg\" alt=\"img_9962\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espainaturalworkshopvergecarme/img_9963.jpg\" alt=\"img_9963\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espainaturalworkshopvergecarme/img_0054.jpg\" alt=\"img_0054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espainaturalworkshopvergecarme/img_0055.jpg\" alt=\"img_0055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espainaturalworkshopvergecarme/img_0056.jpg\" alt=\"img_005